<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class="sqsrte-small"><strong><em>PLEASE NOTE:</em></strong> <strong>RYOKAN WANDERINGS is NOT a travel agency nor a tour guide operator, we DO NOT assist with personal Japan travel itinerary planning.</strong> </p><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class="sqsrte-small"><strong><em>We DO NOT answer inquiries for recommendations, everything featured on this website is something we’ve personally experienced, loved &amp; recommend.</em></strong></p><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class="sqsrte-small">The website blog &amp; eBook series exists to inspire one’s Japan travels, hopefully to discover a lesser known world of Japan. Please make a decision if you’d like to stay at a property shared on the blog/in our eBook independently; taking into account your own personal needs, comforts, tastes and budgets. </p>
</div>




















  
  



